flowchart TD
    A[Turn context, config, model capabilities] --> B[Build ToolRouter]
    B --> C[Direct visible specs]
    B --> D[Deferred searchable metadata]
    C --> E[Model request]
    D --> E
    E --> F{Model response}
    F -->|direct tool call| G[Parse ToolCall]
    F -->|tool_search| H[Search metadata / activate matches]
    H --> I[Next model request with discovered specs]
    I --> F
    G --> J[Registry and payload validation]
    J --> K[Execpolicy evaluation]
    K -->|forbidden| X[Rejected tool result]
    K -->|prompt| L{Approval mode}
    K -->|allow| M[Permission profile]
    L -->|disallowed| X
    L -->|pending| N[User/reviewer decision]
    N -->|deny| X
    N -->|approve| M
    M --> O[Sandbox and network enforcement]
    O --> P[Runtime execution]
    P --> Q[Correlated result]
    Q --> I
